","children":"FLEXAID∆S ↗"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-label":"Entropie de Shannon : moins la somme des probabilités multipliées par leur logarithme en base deux","children":"←   H = −Σ pᵢ log₂ pᵢ   →"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://github.com/LeBonhommePharma/Shannon","children":"SHANNON ↗"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"kernel","className":"kernel wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"section-heading","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"section-index","children":"01 / LE LANGAGE COMMUN"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":["Recenser les possibilités.",["$","br",null,{}],"Préserver leurs poids."]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"kernel-grid","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"L’entropie mesure la répartition de la probabilité sur un ensemble explicite d’options. Un état dominant correspond à une faible entropie. De nombreux états de même poids correspondent à une entropie élevée."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Le même calcul de normalisation et d’entropie s’applique aux états moléculaires et aux choix de jetons. L’espace des états, l’origine des poids et leur signification physique restent propres à chaque domaine."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"kernel-note","children":"Définir d’abord les options. Puis leur mesure. Ensuite seulement, interpréter leur entropie."}],["$","a",null,{"className":"source-inline","href":"https://github.com/LeBonhommePharma/Shannon/blob/5c09cead058d8c84dd40cbaa5706f2457f35ebb2/src/shannon/entropy_algorithm.hpp#L67-L115","children":"Lire l’implémentation commune ↗"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"formula-sheet","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"01 / LOGARITHMES DES POIDS"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"aᵢ"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"02 / NORMALISER"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["L = ln ∑ e",["$","sup",null,{"children":"aᵢ"}],["$","br",null,{}],"pᵢ = e",["$","sup",null,{"children":"aᵢ − L"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"formula-final","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"03 / MESURER"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["H",["$","sub",null,{"children":"nats"}]," = L − ∑ pᵢaᵢ"]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"caption","children":["H",["$","sub",null,{"children":"bits"}]," = H",["$","sub",null,{"children":"nats"}]," / ln 2",["$","br",null,{}],"pᵢ ≥ 0 · ∑ pᵢ = 1 · 0 log 0 = 0"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"stability-note","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"RIGUEUR NUMÉRIQUE"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Soustraire m = max aᵢ avant de prendre l’exponentielle. Calculer L = m + ln ∑ exp(aᵢ − m). Cela stabilise le calcul sans modifier la distribution."}]]}]]}],"$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10"]}],"$L11"]
